                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
<p>
   <lb n="1"/><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/>
   <lb n="2"/><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/>
   <lb n="3"/>{4}ṅ ti [vraḥ] kamra-
   <lb n="4"/>[t]e[ṅ] {2} ti saṣṭhī vraḥ thkvāl nu
   <lb n="5"/>bhagavān rudrāśrama jauv
   <lb n="6"/>[n]u prāk liṅ tapp vyar bhājana vyar
   <lb n="7"/>ṅan jyaṅ tapp ta loñ rau nu
   <lb n="8"/>loñ prāṇa pādamūla kamrateṅ
   <lb n="9"/>jagat vnaṁ kantāl ti vraḥ kamrateṅ
   <lb n="10"/>vraḥ thkvāl cāṁ caṁnāṁ ta kamrateṅ jagat
   <lb n="11"/>vnaṁ kantāl raṅko je I saṅkranta phle bhū-
   <lb n="12"/>mi vnur khliṅ Āyatta ta kule ta mū-
   <lb n="13"/>la nā barṇṇa vraḥ cāmara phle sruk stu-
   <lb n="14"/>k kok padmapura paripālana pradvān
   <lb n="15"/>yajñaśeṣa noḥ liḥ 5 ta qnak ta trvac
   <lb n="16"/>vraḥ rājakāryya liḥ 2 vraḥ bhagavan
   <lb n="17"/>liḥ I ta chmāṁ glāṅ liḥ I ta chmāṁ vraḥ pañji-
   <lb n="18"/>ya liḥ 6 ta qnak ta thve yajña noḥ
</p>     
</div>
